+# Pre-staged .442 roadmap (Pre-Staged Roadmap Convention). Operator-directed 2026-06-26 'a+b':
+# S2-v2 diverse-pool off-path trust gate (fixes the exp4791 degenerate non-test). Built by scripts/_build_roadmap_442.py.
+milestone: 2026.06.442
+planned_by: outer-loop (Claude Opus 4.8 planner, 2026-06-26, operator-directed 'a+b'). S2 (.441 A1, exp4791)
+  was a DEGENERATE NON-TEST (2/5 effective games; energy_minus_accuracy_delta=0.0 an artifact of non-diverse
+  candidate pools), NOT a bounded null. S2-v2 re-tests with an ENFORCED behaviorally-diverse candidate
+  pool + per-game logging + an effective-games gate. The degenerate-pool detector ships as adversarial_verify.check_engine_selection_candidate_diversity
+  (DEGENERATE_CANDIDATE_POOL).
+milestone_title: S2-v2 OFF-PATH TRUST GATE on a DIVERSE candidate pool -- fix the exp4791 degenerate non-test.
+  Generate K behaviorally-diverse candidate engines per game (varied refinement rounds/seeds spanning
+  held-out off-path cell_recall), log per-game energy-vs-accuracy selections, and gate on >=5 EFFECTIVE
+  games so a 0-delta from non-diverse candidates returns INCONCLUSIVE, not a fake null. PASS -> S3 generation
+  lift; GENUINE bounded (diverse pool) -> pivot the energy to S3 directly. Plus the sprint-mandated level-up
+  (rotated), self-play, readiness, reserved infra/hardware/SOTA/capstone.
+milestone_doc: docs/research-notes/oracle-distinct-structural-energy-program-2026-06-26.md
+theme: 'S2 (exp4791) over-claimed a bounded null from a degenerate candidate pool -- the operator caught
+  it and directed (a) an S2-v2 with enforced candidate diversity + per-game logging + an effective-games
+  gate, and (b) a degenerate-pool detector (now shipped as DEGENERATE_CANDIDATE_POOL in adversarial_verify).
+  S2-v2 is the corrected first live test of whether the structural energy beats cheap execution-grounded
+  accuracy at selecting among induced world-models. The honest outcome space: WIN (-> S3), GENUINE bounded
+  (the energy doesn''t beat accuracy on a real diverse test -> pivot to S3 generation), or INCONCLUSIVE
+  (still can''t assemble a diverse pool -> retire the trust-gate framing). S3-S4 remain gated.'
+sprint_forcing_function: ARC-AGI-3 submission sprint through 2026-06-30 (CLAUDE.md). Majority ARC (A1
